[{"op":"set","variable":30001,"value":1920},{"op":"set","variable":30002,"value":1080},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i15"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"来到食堂后――"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10176"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“咦؟!是、是羽依里？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“苍，你也是来实现梦想的吗？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"食堂的大叔","text":"“对啊，小哥要不要一起来？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“哎？但今天那道菜不是为苍准备的吗？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"食堂的大叔","text":"“她应该吃不完。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“……？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"食堂的大叔","text":"“空门家小苍想要的是，怎么吃也吃不完的……那个东西。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10354"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“因、因为！你看，不是有那种东西嘛？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"良一点了羊乐多，天善点了欧乐C。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"说吃不完的话，应该指的不是饮料。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“到底点了什么？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10384"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“……布丁。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“布丁？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10372"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“戳戳布丁。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“嗯，就是那种底部有个凸起，要折断倒扣在盘子上的那种啊。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10173"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“小时候不是一人只能吃一个吗。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10158"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“你就没想过要多吃几个吗？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“啊，我懂。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"这么说的话，会不会像天善那次一样，准备了大量的戳戳布丁呢。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"就像无限荞麦面一样，不管怎么吃都会继续端上来的无限戳戳布丁。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"食堂的大叔","text":"“嘿……哟……嘿咻！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"咚！"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"一个桶被抬到了柜台上。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"它倒扣在大盘子上。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“……这是什么？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10381"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“啊啊啊～……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"食堂的大叔","text":"“是戳戳布丁。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“不，这是桶啊。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"食堂的大叔","text":"“你看这里。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"桶底有个凸起。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10349"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“可、可以吗？我可以戳吗？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"食堂的大叔","text":"“嗯，来吧。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10173"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“哈～……”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10208"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“嘿呀!!”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"啵……"},{"op":"text","speaker":"食堂的大叔","text":"“小哥，帮我把桶往上提。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“该不会……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"按捺不住心跳加速的预感。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"双手捧着冰凉的桶，慢慢往上提。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"飘散着甜甜的香气……"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"啊啊……这就是……"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10238"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“戳戳布丁啊～”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"在盘子上，闪耀着柔软又有弹性的乳黄色光泽。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“原来如此，是这么回事啊……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"食堂的大叔","text":"“配方和可力高的一模一样哦。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“哎？这种东西不是企业机密吗？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"食堂的大叔","text":"“嘿，原配方的来源……说不定就近在眼前呢。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“…………”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"大叔……你到底是什么人啊？"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10381"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“可以吃吗？现在就可以吃吗？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"食堂的大叔","text":"“嗯，尽情享用吧。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10349"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“我开始吃了。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"她用备好的大勺子，戳了戳布丁。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"看着布丁摇头晃脑的样子，很是享受。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"虽然柔软，但不会轻易被勺子切开。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"不过，一旦勺子的尖端插入，就会像包裹着勺子一样接纳它。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10363"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“啊呜……嗯嗯……嗯嗯……”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10349"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“嗯――！好甜――！就是这个味道！”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10115"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“来，你也一起吃吧。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“可以吗？这是你点的布丁吧。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10112"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“没关系，毕竟这么大一个我绝对吃不完。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“这种点法真的好吗……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"食堂的大叔","text":"“我只负责实现梦想，仅此而已。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“大叔……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"太帅气了……"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i15"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"――然后。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10189"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“……还不够。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10162"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“我还没吃够！”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10165"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“你吃太多了！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“可是，这个太好吃了！这可是戳戳布丁啊؟!”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"因为两个人吃得狼吞虎咽，结果害得苍没能吃到心满意足。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"咚！"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10176"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“咦？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“又来了一桶？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"食堂的大叔","text":"“梦想，一定要实现啊。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“大叔……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"太帅气了。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10381"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“我开始吃了！”"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i203"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10348"},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10348"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"――眼前的苍，真真切切地实现了儿时的梦想，身心都得到了满足。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"这一次，我就在一旁静静地望着她。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"为了让苍能够真的吃到尽兴。"},{"op":"clear","layer":1280},{"op":"clear","layer":1536},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i15"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"苍的梦想也――……实现了。"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"return"},{"op":"end"}]